114:{"timestamp":"2026-07-29T08:17:02.107Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The first invariant reached the one-element base residual, so the loop shape and fold are aligned. The remaining mismatch is exactly the expected dynamic-sort issue: the loop variable is a `Val` known by the path condition to be a `Float`, while the summary carries its total float projection. I’m applying the Kit’s guarded projection/definedness idiom, which connects those representations without inventing a value.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
