  ✓ Verify launcher provenance, campaign lock, required records, and semantics integrity
  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent Python differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild definitions cleanly and rerun every positive K proof claim
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and all local K rules
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation for non-vacuity
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md with verdict
